  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e0a2b1bd2aa20e6f",
      "translationZh": "嵌入模型可用于检索、重排序、聚类和分类等多种应用。近年来，研究界见证了嵌入模型的显著进展，使所有基于语义表示的应用都得到了大幅改进。BGE、GTE 和 E5 等模型在 MTEB 基准测试中名列前茅，在某些情况下甚至优于专有嵌入服务。Hugging Face 的模型中心提供了多种规模的模型，从轻量级模型（100-350M 参数）到 7B 模型（如 Salesforce/SFR-Embedding-Mistral）不等。基于编码器架构的轻量级模型，是在运行语义搜索类应用（如检索增强生成（RAG））的 CPU 后端上进行优化和使用的理想选择。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "74ceb48429a77dc9",
      "translationZh": "在这篇博客中，我们将展示如何在基于 Xeon 的 CPU 上实现显著的性能提升，并展示使用 fastRAG 将优化后的模型集成到现有 RAG 流水线中有多么容易。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "4252697cd867503f",
      "translationZh": "使用嵌入模型进行信息检索",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c26e2723d0cbb7d4",
      "translationZh": "嵌入模型将文本数据编码为稠密向量，捕捉语义和上下文含义。通过更充分地结合上下文来表示词语与文档之间的关系，这种方式能够实现准确的信息检索。通常，语义相似度通过嵌入向量之间的余弦相似度来衡量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ac0f7edb80819a19",
      "translationZh": "信息检索是否总应使用稠密向量？两种主流方法各有取舍：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2a4b5dd48db21bf5",
      "translationZh": "稀疏检索通过匹配 n-gram、短语或元数据，对大型集合进行高效的大规模搜索。不过，由于查询与文档之间存在词汇差异，它可能会漏掉相关文档。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c393c13da1c8fdc9",
      "translationZh": "语义检索将文本编码为稠密向量，比词袋方法更能捕捉上下文和含义。即使词汇不匹配，它也能检索到语义相关的文档。不过，与 BM25 这样的词汇匹配方法相比，它的计算开销大、延迟更高，而且需要复杂的编码模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c10d713635ebba8e",
      "translationZh": "嵌入模型与 RAG",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a4e1e8162f0b1be7",
      "translationZh": "嵌入模型在 RAG 应用中发挥着多种关键作用：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "16bc119c7da3746b",
      "translationZh": "离线流程：在为检索文档库（索引）建立索引或进行更新时，将文档编码为稠密向量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1b6f17cecef847a5",
      "translationZh": "查询编码：在查询时，将输入查询编码为稠密向量表示，用于检索。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "71bfece88c79d454",
      "translationZh": "重排序：在初步检索之后，可以将检索到的文档编码为稠密向量，并与查询向量进行比较，从而对这些文档重新排序。这使得最初没有稠密表示的文档也能参与重排序。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e9397deb436cd0f8",
      "translationZh": "为了获得更高效的体验，非常有必要优化 RAG 流水线中的嵌入模型组件，具体而言：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5600f67144bc7a42",
      "translationZh": "文档索引建立与更新：更高的吞吐量能够在初始设置或定期更新期间，更快地对大规模文档集合进行编码并建立索引。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "c0bfd1716bfb5725",
      "translationZh": "查询编码：更低的查询编码延迟对于实现响应迅速的实时检索至关重要。更高的吞吐量支持高效地编码大量并发查询，从而实现可扩展性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9aac46886de4287a",
      "translationZh": "检索文档重排序：在初步检索之后，嵌入模型需要快速对检索到的候选文档进行编码，以便重排序。更低的延迟能够为时间敏感型应用快速完成文档重排序。更高的吞吐量支持并行地对更大的候选集合进行重排序，从而实现更全面的重排序。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "46bd0843870dc750",
      "translationZh": "使用 Optimum Intel 和 IPEX 优化嵌入模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "72bc125e80eabd6a",
      "translationZh": "Optimum Intel 是一个开源库，可在 Intel 硬件上加速使用 Hugging Face 库构建的端到端流水线。Optimum Intel 包含多种模型加速技术，例如低比特量化、模型权重剪枝、蒸馏以及加速运行时。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e3db8b8911211101",
      "translationZh": "Optimum Intel 中包含的运行时和优化利用 Intel CPU 上的 Intel® Advanced Vector Extensions 512 (Intel® AVX-512)、Vector Neural Network Instructions (VNNI) 和 Intel® Advanced Matrix Extensions (Intel® AMX) 来加速模型。具体而言，其每个核心都内置了 BFloat16 (bf16) 和 int8 GEMM 加速器，用于加速深度学习训练和推理工作负载。PyTorch 2.0 和 Intel Extension for PyTorch (IPEX) 引入了 AMX 加速推理，同时还针对各种常见算子提供了其他优化。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6ff98e66bd702a45",
      "translationZh": "使用 Optimum Intel 可以轻松优化预训练模型；这里可以找到许多简单示例。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "29a890a21dc7961b",
      "translationZh": "示例：优化 BGE 嵌入模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c775d85aca096c15",
      "translationZh": "在这篇博客中，我们重点介绍北京智源人工智能研究院的研究人员最近发布的嵌入模型，因为这些模型在广泛采用的 MTEB 排行榜上取得了具有竞争力的成绩。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e530716e5c994631",
      "translationZh": "BGE 技术细节",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c905cad6be976af5",
      "translationZh": "双编码器模型是基于 Transformer 的编码器，其训练目标是最小化两个语义相似文本的向量表示之间的相似性度量，例如余弦相似度。例如，流行的嵌入模型使用 BERT 模型作为基础预训练模型，并对其进行微调，以生成文档的嵌入表示。表示编码后文本的向量由模型输出生成；例如，它可以是 [CLS] 词元向量，也可以是所有词元向量的均值。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "27949400f6bd9513",
      "translationZh": "与更复杂的嵌入架构不同，双编码器仅对单个文档进行编码，因此缺乏查询与文档、文档与文档等被编码实体之间的上下文交互。不过，最先进的双编码器嵌入模型表现出了有竞争力的性能，而且由于架构简单，速度极快。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a5fa8958101e2169",
      "translationZh": "我们重点关注 3 个 BGE 模型：small、base 和 large，它们分别包含 45M、110M 和 355M 个参数，编码生成的嵌入向量维度分别为 384/768/1024。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8f52db4658d0e786",
      "translationZh": "需要指出的是，我们在下文展示的优化流程具有通用性，也适用于其他嵌入模型（包括双编码器、交叉编码器等）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "277510767352c94f",
      "translationZh": "分步指南：通过量化进行优化",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e550bb26d344bfd5",
      "translationZh": "我们将逐步介绍如何提升嵌入模型的性能，重点是降低延迟（批大小为 1）并提高吞吐量（以每秒编码的文档数衡量）。这套方案利用 optimum-intel 和 Intel Neural Compressor 对模型进行量化，并使用 IPEX 优化在基于 Intel 的硬件上的运行时性能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "6fbbb0f99ce02b18",
      "translationZh": "步骤 1：安装软件包",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "735ce4002b6f3ab5",
      "translationZh": "要安装 optimum-intel 和 intel-extension-for-transformers，请运行以下命令：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "a0f448df587554db",
      "translationZh": "步骤 2：训练后静态量化",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "53b33b2fd7da94c5",
      "translationZh": "训练后静态量化需要一个校准集，用于确定权重和激活值的动态范围。校准过程是将一组有代表性的数据样本输入模型运行，收集统计信息，然后根据收集到的信息对模型进行量化，以尽可能减少精度损失。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b860b33d93c4e290",
      "translationZh": "以下代码片段展示了如何进行量化：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "05fdf74376deebf0",
      "translationZh": "在校准过程中，我们使用了 qasper 数据集的一个子集。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "160ddab669fabc4c",
      "translationZh": "步骤 3：加载并运行推理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4326dcb3d1c90f50",
      "translationZh": "只需运行以下内容，即可加载量化后的模型：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3e6bbc61b09552c6",
      "translationZh": "将句子编码为向量的方式，与我们惯用的 Transformers 库中的做法类似：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4ae733a78382a1d9",
      "translationZh": "在下方的评估部分，我们提供了有关如何配置 CPU 后端的更多重要细节（正确的机器配置）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "91201bff8914ec6d",
      "translationZh": "使用 MTEB 进行模型评估",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5e1422b415f6d0b9",
      "translationZh": "将模型权重量化为较低精度会造成准确性损失，因为从 fp32 权重转为 int8 时会损失精度。因此，我们希望通过以下两项 MTEB 任务，将优化后的模型与原始模型进行比较，以验证其准确性：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "f9b5606e3c953792",
      "translationZh": "检索——对语料库进行编码，并根据给定查询搜索索引，生成排序后的结果列表。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6c8140b9b67a2a95",
      "translationZh": "重排序——根据给定查询，对检索结果重新排序，以提高相关性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0fb82a53b6081aa8",
      "translationZh": "下表展示了各类任务在多个数据集上的平均准确性（重排序使用 MAP，检索使用 NDCG@10），其中 int8 是我们量化后的模型，fp32 是原始模型（结果取自 MTEB 官方排行榜）。与原始模型相比，量化模型在重排序任务中的误差率低于 1%，在检索任务中的误差率低于 1.55%。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5a38cf2eca2edeea",
      "translationZh": "重排序",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1c3d1a7d17bf211d",
      "translationZh": "检索",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6feb7924164c7020",
      "translationZh": "int8 fp32 差异 0.5826 0.5836 -0.17% 0.5886 0.5886 0% 0.5985 0.6003 -0.3%",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bd9622d8241bc2fd",
      "translationZh": "int8 fp32 差异 0.5138 0.5168 -0.58% 0.5242 0.5325 -1.55% 0.5346 0.5429 -1.53%",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "df087996d45b03e7",
      "translationZh": "差异",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0079",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "aee336f153fbdd90",
      "translationZh": "速度与延迟",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0080",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1cfdfb8e9ce9552b",
      "translationZh": "我们将自家模型的性能与另外两种常见模型使用方式的性能进行了比较：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0081",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "873b91a30c408278",
      "translationZh": "使用 PyTorch 和 Huggingface 的 Transformers 库，采用 bf16。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0082",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b292a2b4caa0f2ff",
      "translationZh": "使用 Intel extension for PyTorch (IPEX) 运行时，采用 bf16，并使用 torchscript 对模型进行追踪。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0083",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fcdea6a8fee0d12d",
      "translationZh": "实验配置说明：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0084",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "94ed7aede92ecffa",
      "translationZh": "硬件（CPU）：第 4 代 Intel Xeon 8480+，配备 2 个插槽，每个插槽 56 个核心。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0085",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e794b28c4a3fa97b",
      "translationZh": "Pytorch 模型在 1 个 CPU 插槽上使用 56 个核心进行了评估。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0086",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "64bb6ad2151bed26",
      "translationZh": "IPEX/Optimum 配置使用 ipexrun 在 1 个 CPU 插槽上进行了评估，所用核心数范围为 22-56。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0087",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "31246a945214a3e5",
      "translationZh": "所有运行均安装了 TCMalloc，并通过环境变量进行了配置。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0088",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "89778d6ccf244e1f",
      "translationZh": "我们是如何进行评估的？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0089",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "46bd95a7b76ed224",
      "translationZh": "我们创建了一个脚本，使用模型的词表生成随机样例。我们加载了原始模型和优化后的模型，并比较了在上述两种场景中对这些样例进行编码所需的时间：批大小为 1 时的编码延迟，以及使用批量样例编码时的吞吐量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0090",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8fb10dbcc3204858",
      "translationZh": "基线 PyTorch 和 Hugging Face：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0091",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "10e106e891a7ae65",
      "translationZh": "IPEX torchscript 和 bf16：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0092",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "885c0ab82061f8b2",
      "translationZh": "使用 IPEX 和 int8 模型的 Optimum Intel：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0093",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "831bac0f4c92bad9",
      "translationZh": "延迟表现",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0094",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bbc00985c6721f5c",
      "translationZh": "在这项评估中，我们旨在衡量模型的响应速度。这是在 RAG 流水线中对查询进行编码的一个示例用例。在这项评估中，我们将批大小设为 1，并测量不同文档长度下的延迟。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0095",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6d9d617fddfbab35",
      "translationZh": "我们可以看到，量化模型的整体延迟表现最佳，small 和 base 模型的延迟低于 10 ms，large 模型的延迟 <20 ms。与原始模型相比，量化模型在延迟方面实现了最高 4.5 倍的加速。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0096",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "be1e996d0683c6aa",
      "translationZh": "图 1. BGE 模型的延迟。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0097",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "51f2f953744caca2",
      "translationZh": "吞吐量表现",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0098",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "69551c0f1a695b6a",
      "translationZh": "在吞吐量评估中，我们旨在寻找以每秒处理文档数衡量的峰值编码性能。我们将文本长度设为 256 个 token，因为这一长度可以较好地估计 RAG 流水线中文档的平均长度，并使用不同的批大小（4、8、16、32、64、128、256）进行评估。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0099",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a0c4d4c64a8e9d68",
      "translationZh": "结果表明，与其他模型相比，量化模型达到了更高的吞吐量，并在批大小为 128 时达到峰值吞吐量。总体而言，对于所有模型规模，在不同批大小下，量化模型相较于基线 bf16 模型实现了最高 4 倍的提升。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0100",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "da241c2dae4f28d9",
      "translationZh": "图 2. BGE small 的吞吐量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0101",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e71f782c957c4793",
      "translationZh": "图 3. BGE base 的吞吐量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0102",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "71007787e1b68a7e",
      "translationZh": "图 4. BGE large 的吞吐量。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0103",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "da19e5682b670534",
      "translationZh": "在 fastRAG 中使用优化后的嵌入模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0104",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0b3b7fd5f64e3a44",
      "translationZh": "作为示例，我们将演示如何将优化后的检索/重排序模型集成到 fastRAG 中（这些模型也可以轻松集成到 Langchain 和 LlamaIndex 等其他 RAG 框架中）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0105",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c40b3cde3b5a616c",
      "translationZh": "fastRAG 是由 Intel Labs 开发的研究框架，用于构建高效、优化的检索增强生成流水线，融合了最先进的 LLM 和信息检索技术。fastRAG 与 Haystack 完全兼容，并包含新颖且高效的 RAG 模块，支持在 Intel 硬件上高效部署。要开始使用 fastRAG，我们邀请读者查看此处的安装说明，并按照我们的指南上手使用 fastRAG。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0106",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5423b26bf0279e96",
      "translationZh": "我们在两个模块中集成了优化后的双编码器嵌入模型：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0107",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0e28750f1d18ba54",
      "translationZh": "QuantizedBiEncoderRetriever – 用于为文档建立索引，并从稠密索引中检索文档",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0108",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "745eeece62ec7aa3",
      "translationZh": "QuantizedBiEncoderRanker – 用于使用嵌入模型对文档列表进行重排序，作为复杂检索流水线的一部分。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0109",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c81903dadbf60941",
      "translationZh": "使用优化后的 Retriever 快速构建索引",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0110",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8b389e10c8827555",
      "translationZh": "让我们使用采用了优化嵌入模型的稠密检索器来创建稠密索引。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0111",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2c4addbcbd9f6aaf",
      "translationZh": "首先，创建一个文档存储：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0112",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1a7afbaafa8f3f72",
      "translationZh": "然后，向其中添加一些文档：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0113",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7f26508678441fd2",
      "translationZh": "加载一个采用了优化双编码器嵌入模型的 Retriever，并对文档存储中的所有文档进行编码：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0114",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "7825eb5df19c7b01",
      "translationZh": "使用优化后的 Ranker 进行重排序",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0115",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "26955b8c92da7472",
      "translationZh": "下面的示例展示了如何将优化后的模型加载到排序器节点中，该节点会根据给定查询，对其从索引中检索到的所有文档进行编码和重排序：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0116",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2a0df2fdd7cefa1f",
      "translationZh": "完成！创建好的流水线可用于从文档存储中检索文档，并使用（另一个）嵌入模型对检索到的文档进行排序，从而重新排列这些文档。本 notebook 提供了一个更完整的示例。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0117",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8801f562f234a284",
      "translationZh": "有关更多 RAG 相关方法、模型和示例，我们邀请读者探索 fastRAG/examples 笔记本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
  "wordWise": [
    {
